            "key": "moment-03",
            "say": "反过来，如果已知斜边与其中一条直角边，比如斜边为 13、一条直角边为 5，我们同样可以通过移项求出另一条直角边。",
            "delivery": "careful",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "write",
                "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
                "kind": "math",
                "role": "derivation",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "b = \\sqrt{c^2 - a^2} = \\sqrt{13^2 - 5^2} = \\sqrt{169 - 25} = 12"
                },
                "place": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
                },
                "when": "during_speech"
              }
            ]
